WEBVTT

00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:05.480
The victim's face and head were 
smashed in by a blunt object.

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:09.480
It was so bad that we couldn't identify 
his face or match any dental records,

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:13.740
but we're certain that the victim 
is Sergeant Terada Tokunosuke.

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.380
We're unsure why Detective Terada 
went to an abandoned gas station

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:19.830
by himself in the middle of the night.

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:22.970
On his cellphone, we found some 
personal conversations via messages

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:25.330
exchanged between the two of you.

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:30.020
The estimated time of death is today, 
September 4th, between 2:00 and 3:00 AM.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:33.350
Where were you at that hour, 
and what were you doing?

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:38.010
I was at home alone.

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:10.820
The body of a man thought 
to be an officer of the

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:13.480
<b>Makurazaka City Police</b>

00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:13.480
Makurazaka City Police Department 
was discovered around 6:00 AM.

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:15.740
It was reported that a body 
with the face smashed in

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:18.490
was found at an abandoned gas 
station along the freeway...

00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:20.990
You okay?

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:24.370
Sir...

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:26.850
Yes, I'm all right.

00:02:26.850 --> 00:02:30.580
Terada seemed really happy lately 
because he was hitting it off with you.

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:37.520
There's a very high chance he was killed 
due to a grudge incurred on the job.

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:43.200
Just like yourself, the other police 
officers are being questioned, as well.

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:46.510
The members of the Makurazaka Police 
Department are the ones being questioned.

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:49.740
By the way, Yumihara-kun,

00:02:49.740 --> 00:02:53.500
is it true that Terada-kun was 
investigating Steel Lady Nanase?

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:57.030
Yes. He asked me about that during 
my interrogation, so I mentioned it then.

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:59.900
They seemed to know about it...

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:02.240
Wait, did that get out to the media?

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.390
No, it hasn't.

00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:07.740
But there are people who 
are tying the incident

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:09.480
with Terada to Steel Lady Nanase,

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:12.630
since his face was smashed in and it 
happened in the middle of the night.

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:16.620
Apparently, that's making people 
believe it was Steel Lady Nanase.

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:18.430
Talk about a sick joke.

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:20.590
Yes. It's quite irresponsible...

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:23.590
