impossible to completely cut her off.

00:13:57.610 --> 00:14:02.270
People seek dreams in their stories 
and hope that reality is similar.

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:05.410
The interpretation of an 
indicent as coincidental

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:09.490
is more disappointing than the 
interpretation that it was fate.

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:11.540
<i>If this was a real incident,</i>

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:13.950
<i>and we had the data and 
deduction skills we need,</i>

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:15.910
<i>we could've tracked down the truth by now.</i>

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:19.620
<i>But what she's trying to do is conceal the truth</i>

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:22.670
<i>and create a truth with a 
culprit that doesn't even exist.</i>

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:28.050
<i>We basically want people to believe, 
"Of course. That's totally possible."</i>

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:30.260
<b>Do not cross this bridge</b>

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:31.870
<i>So it's not deduction that 
people are looking for here.</i>

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:33.510
<i>They want something else.</i>

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:35.690
What to do...

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:36.980
<i>Yes. This isn't about deductions.</i>

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:39.110
Then I'll just go down the middle!

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:39.110
<i>Which is it?</i>

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:44.110
This isn't good!

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:46.910
Even if we're able to explain 
everything rationally,

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:49.450
the mere existence of Steel Lady Nanase

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:53.240
as an explanation for this 
case is surprisingly effective.

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:56.470
Making this explanation simple, 
logical, and convincing

00:14:56.470 --> 00:15:00.000
is far more difficult than one would imagine.

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:05.750
<i>Up until yesterday, people were wondering 
who was behind these random attacks.</i>

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:05.270
Culprit

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:07.730
<i>What was their motive?</i>

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:10.970
<i>If we create fake versions of these 
two and it gains enough traction,</i>

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:13.510
<i>we'd be able to make 
Steel Lady Nanase disappear.</i>

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:18.520
<i>But now, we have a number of things 
we're going to have to make up.</i>

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:21.690
<i>First, why did these 
countless attempted attacks</i>

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:24.510
<i>by someone who is supposedly 
Steel Lady Nanase happen?</i>

00:15:24.510 --> 00:15:27.530
<i>Second, who actually 
perpetrated these incidents?</i>

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:31.880
<i>Third, why was Detective Terada killed 
in a way that made it look like</i>

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:33.030
<i>Steel Lady Nanase did it?</i>

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:36.790
<i>Fourth, why was Detective Terada 
killed with no resistance?</i>

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:40.160
<i>Fifth, who actually 
killed Detective Terada?</i>

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:45.920
<i>But solving this won't be enough. 
We have to make these lies work for us.</i>

