00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:53.570
<i>Without greatly harming 
an actual existing person.</i>

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:57.540
<i>And we need to make sure that a lot 
of people agree with this explanation.</i>

00:15:57.540 --> 00:15:59.590
<i>If we can manage all of these things,</i>

00:15:59.590 --> 00:16:02.190
<i>will we be able to make 
Steel Lady Nanase disappear?</i>

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:06.170
<i>Even though we have an advantage 
with Kuro-kun's abilities,</i>

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:08.410
<i>this is still a very difficult situation.</i>

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:09.780
Iwanaga.

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:14.990
If one solution isn't enough, 
why not stack up several?

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:18.410
It's not like Steel Lady Nanase 
was born yesterday.

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:20.540
There must've been trial and error

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:22.980
until she was actually 
able to commit the murder.

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:25.450
Rumors were spread, the site was created,

00:16:25.450 --> 00:16:28.170
and posts gained attention, 
making this popular.

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:34.400
They must've used various methods to 
make sure her popularity didn't fade.

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:37.140
Otherwise, a monster of the 
imagination shouldn't have

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:39.540
been able to manifest in 
such short order in this age.

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:46.930
We're not limited to one solution.

00:16:46.930 --> 00:16:48.820
You said so yourself earlier.

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:50.820
Divide each difficulty.

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:56.010
We can take steps to make the reality, 
the hundreds of thousands of fantasies,

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:58.990
all closer to the solution 
you want to create.

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:03.500
Until then, I'll continue to determine 
the future that's going to happen.

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:09.130
But if that happens, you'll die several times.

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:12.030
You did say yesterday that 
you intended to do that.

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:13.130
I did, didn't I?

00:17:37.350 --> 00:17:39.700
<i>She's been breaking down all the 
information since yesterday,</i>

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:43.200
<i>trying to figure out how we can use it 
and what truths we can make into lies.</i>

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:47.250
<i>What's uncertain? What's certain?</i>

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:50.250
<i>She must've tried many 
things over and over.</i>

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:54.650
<i>Taking the misshapen blocks 
that exist in reality and</i>

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:58.640
<i>determining how to create a past 
that doesn't exist in reality...</i>

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:05.390
<i>Rather than seeking the truth, 
creating a ridiculous and ludicrous fiction.</i>

00:18:06.090 --> 00:18:08.830
<i>That's about to be completed.</i>

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.410
Yes, that's sweet.

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:28.540
You got this?

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:30.290
Yes.

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:33.040
I've come up with four solutions.

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:36.550
And now, I'm going to use them 
to round out a truth that I want.

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:41.930
I will defeat Steel Lady Nanase 
tonight, no matter what.

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:06.650
I'm going to sleep for a bit.

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:08.750
Please wake me up right before 9:00.

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:13.380
Until then, if there's word of 
Steel Lady Nanase appearing,

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:16.340
at that point...

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:26.970
Let's have some food ready for 
Iwanaga when she wakes up.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:30.400
We should probably eat something, too.

00:19:30.400 --> 00:19:31.100
Right.

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:33.350
We've ordered the yokai and monsters

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:37.480
around the city to contact us 
if they see Steel Lady Nanase.

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:40.410
If we hear anything, 
I'll head to the scene

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:42.490
and stop Steel Lady Nanase 
from going anywhere else.

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:45.830
I can fight all night if needed

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:49.250
so I can stop Steel Lady Nanase and make 
sure there aren't any more victims.

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:51.870
What if Steel Lady Nanase escapes?

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:55.370
We'll use our intel to find 
her again, and I'll stop her.

00:19:55.370 --> 00:19:56.620
That seems troublesome.

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:58.250
But it's the best way.

00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:03.590
And if we hear from any of them, 
I'd like you to help me to the scene.

00:20:04.150 --> 00:20:05.890
I've procured a rental car.

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:10.180
I'm sorry to involve you in all 
of this, but can I count on you?

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:13.750
I also don't want to see any more victims.

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:15.940
Besides, I need to get over this already.

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:18.690
Has it been a while

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:21.340
since you started going out with her?

00:20:21.850 --> 00:20:24.950
It's been around two and 
a half years since we met.

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:27.380
So right after we broke up?

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:30.420
Iwanaga started talking to me in May,

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:33.460
but it's not like we started 
dating immediately.

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:36.650
I had no intention of going out with her.

00:20:36.650 --> 00:20:39.300
It's not like I have any right to complain,

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:40.710
but I believe you.

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:45.110
I mean, she's the exact opposite of your type.

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:47.430
Yes, you're exactly right.

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:50.680
<i>And yet, you two seem to 
be doing perfectly fine.</i>

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:53.890
I think it's good.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:58.270
You shouldn't keep chasing 
after Rikka-san, anyway.

00:21:02.710 --> 00:21:06.060
Why did you bring up Rikka-san's name?

00:21:06.060 --> 00:21:10.750
Because your type is 100% Rikka-san.

00:21:11.820 --> 00:21:13.370
<i>Sakuragawa Rikka.</i>

00:21:14.050 --> 00:21:16.620
<i>Kuro-kun's cousin who's 
three years older than him.</i>

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:19.850
<i>I'd heard rumors that she'd passed,</i>

00:21:19.850 --> 00:21:22.340
<i>but while Kuro-kun and I were dating,</i>

00:21:22.970 --> 00:21:26.430
<i>she was a long-term patient 
at a university hospital.</i>

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:29.430
<b>Homei University</b>

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:29.430
She's hospitalized for routine tests? 
For three years?

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:32.190
Yes, well, a lot happened.

00:21:32.610 --> 00:21:35.060
I didn't go that often in high school,

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:37.510
but since the hospital is 
close to the university,

00:21:37.510 --> 00:21:39.690
I get to go visit her more often now.

00:21:41.430 --> 00:21:43.980
Then will you introduce 
me to her sometime?

00:21:43.980 --> 00:21:46.110
Sure, of course.

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:49.620
Sakuragawa Rikka-sama

00:22:05.990 --> 00:22:07.300
<i>She was a beautiful woman</i>

00:22:08.130 --> 00:22:11.460
<i>with pale skin and a frail body.</i>

00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:16.290
To Be Continued

