<b>Preview</b>

00:23:46.980 --> 00:23:50.610
Steel Lady Nanase is gradually 
steeling her existence.

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:53.130
Who is this Sakuragawa Rikka who's

00:23:53.130 --> 00:23:55.200
controlling the future from the shadows?

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:57.620
Next time, "She Who Spins Fiction."
